$HTZ The new widespread interest from retail this week is exciting and will ultimately provide short term support, but in order to sustain higher, HTZ will need a strong Q3.  Here are a few insightful quotes that have me excited for Q3 (and beyond): 

Sandeep Dube: 

&quot;Early Q3 results indicate that we are on track to deliver meaningful RPD gains again.&quot; 

&quot;The industry pricing environment, as we sit here today, continues to be supportive. Demand for our brands is healthy.&quot;

@PeakBagger Sub 1 p/s on small cap US Defense is unheard of. I looked around on names I know and nothing in market comes close. 

A $20 mil single contract at this evaluation would equate to $NVDA getting a near $2 TRILLION single contract. 1/3 of MC. 

How dumb does that sound?

